  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2023 Somalia Humanitarian Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of humanitarian support in Somalia, including life-saving assistance to people affected by food shortages and malnutrition. The International Committee of the Red Cross with the National Society will distribute emergency relief, with a particular focus on the needs of malnourished children and pregnant/lactating women in internally displaced persons settlements and host communities.</narrative>
  </description>
